      "html": "<div class=\"brief-dashboard\"><section class=\"module full\"><h3>重大新闻汇总</h3><div class=\"news-list\"><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag geo\">国际</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">中东/伊朗风险继续牵动能源安全，油价回落但尾部风险未消失</div><div class=\"news-detail\">WTI 约 70 美元附近回落，利于通胀预期，但霍尔木兹航运、制裁和军事误判仍是 A/H 风险偏好变量。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag geo\">国际</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">隔夜美股分化，资金从高估值科技向业绩确定性筛选</div><div class=\"news-detail\">道指上涨、标普小跌、纳指回落；A/H 科技需要量能和南向资金验证。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag tech\">科技</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">Micron 盘后大涨，HBM/存储周期重新成为 AI 硬件链核心验证</div><div class=\"news-detail\">MU 盘后大涨直接映射存储、封测、代工和国产半导体情绪。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag tech\">科技</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">港股半导体昨日已提前大涨，今天重点看承接而非追高</div><div class=\"news-detail\">中芯国际、华虹半导体昨日涨幅较高，利好可能部分被计价。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag tech\">科技</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">平台型恒科权重修复，腾讯强于阿里、美团仍偏弱</div><div class=\"news-detail\">腾讯、小米是指数修复的重要观察点，美团和本地生活链仍要等业绩预期改善。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag tech\">科技</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">AI 云和大模型交易从估值叙事转向利润兑现</div><div class=\"news-detail\">隔夜 AI 链分化，A/H 软件、云和算力链更看业绩映射。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag earn\">财报</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">Micron：盘后结果显著改善，股价盘后大涨</div><div class=\"news-detail\">市场解读为收入/EPS/指引优于此前悲观交易，利好 A/H 半导体但需防抢跑兑现。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag earn\">财报</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">FedEx：收入/EPS beat 后股价反应仍弱</div><div class=\"news-detail\">利润率和指引压制股价，映射外需、物流和跨境电商链不宜只按反弹交易。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag earn\">财报</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">Cerebras：AI 芯片收入与指引 beat，但市场审查亏损和交付</div><div class=\"news-detail\">AI 硬件不是只看收入增速，A/H 高估值算力链要看毛利和订单质量。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag earn\">财报</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">今日盘前新增大型中概/恒科财报：可验证信息不足</div><div class=\"news-detail\">未抓到足够新的大型中概或恒科权重财报结果，不编造 beat/miss。</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"module takeaway full\"><h3>今日结论</h3><p><strong>事实：</strong>A股和港股从前一日急跌后修复，恒生科技强于恒指；隔夜纳指仍弱，但 MU 盘后大涨。</p><p><strong>判断：</strong>A股更可能震荡修复，科技成长强于大盘价值；港股半导体可能先冲高，持续性看腾讯、小米、中芯和华虹能否共振放量。</p><p><strong>不确定性：</strong>MU 利好可能已被部分计价，中东油价消息可能反复，新增大型中概/恒科财报不足。</p></section><div class=\"module-grid\"><section class=\"module\"><h3>关键资产图</h3><div class=\"asset-strip\"><div class=\"asset-row\"><span>沪深300</span><div class=\"bar up\"><i style=\"width:55%\"></i></div><b class=\"positive\">修复</b></div><div class=\"asset-row\"><span>恒生科技</span><div class=\"bar up\"><i style=\"width:68%\"></i></div><b class=\"positive\">偏强</b></div><div class=\"asset-row\"><span>标普期货</span><div class=\"bar up\"><i style=\"width:56%\"></i></div><b class=\"positive\">小涨</b></div><div class=\"asset-row\"><span>恒指期货</span><div class=\"bar down\"><i style=\"width:45%\"></i></div><b class=\"negative\">偏弱</b></div></div></section><section class=\"module\"><h3>关键词云图</h3><div class=\"word-cloud\"><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"美光盘后大涨重新强化 HBM 与存储周期。\" class=\"w5 bull\">美光</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"港股半导体昨日已大涨，今天更看承接。\" class=\"w5 neutral\">半导体</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"恒生科技昨日强于恒指，但需平台权重确认。\" class=\"w4 bull\">恒生科技</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"中东风险降温但尾部风险仍在。\" class=\"w4 neutral\">中东油价</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"腾讯是港股科技修复的重要稳定器。\" class=\"w3 bull\">腾讯</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"中芯华虹抢跑后重点看量价承接。\" class=\"w3 neutral\">中芯华虹</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"AI 云仍有需求，但市场要求利润兑现。\" class=\"w3 neutral\">AI云</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"外需物流指引偏弱。\" class=\"w2 bear\">外需物流</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"南向若继续买入权重将改善持续性。\" class=\"w2 bull\">南向资金</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"恒指期货偏弱，大盘层面仍有压力。\" class=\"w1 bear\">期货偏弱</span></div><div class=\"cloud-legend\"><span><i class=\"bull-dot\"></i>利好</span><span><i class=\"bear-dot\"></i>利空</span><span><i class=\"neutral-dot\"></i>中性</span></div></section></div><section class=\"module full\"><h3>重点个股推荐</h3><div class=\"stock-picks\"><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">中芯国际</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">0981.HK / 688981.SH</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge watch\">承接验证</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>MU 大涨强化存储和先进制程情绪。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>放量站稳昨日高位、封测设备链同步走强。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>昨日已抢跑，高开缩量易回落。</p></div><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">华虹半导体</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">1347.HK</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge watch\">高弹性</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>资金集中在半导体弹性方向。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>存储链和晶圆代工同步放量。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>涨幅高，兑现压力也高。</p></div><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">腾讯控股</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">0700.HK</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge\">平台权重</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>港股科技反弹扩散的关键权重。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>南向流入、游戏广告预期改善。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>若平台股不跟随，反弹会变窄。</p></div><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">小米集团</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">1810.HK</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge\">消费电子</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>消费电子和智能车双重弹性。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>手机/汽车交付数据和恒科风险偏好改善。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>若行情只在半导体，跟随不足。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"module full\"><h3>板块轮动看板</h3><div class=\"sector-board\"><div class=\"sector-tile\"><b class=\"positive\">强势观察</b><span>半导体、先进封装、封测设备、恒生科技平台权重。</span></div><div class=\"sector-tile\"><b class=\"watch\">事件驱动</b><span>MU 盘后大涨带动 HBM/存储映射。</span></div><div class=\"sector-tile\"><b class=\"negative\">压力方向</b><span>本地生活、外需物流、高估值纯主题 AI。</span></div><div class=\"sector-tile\"><b>验证信号</b><span>中芯/华虹是否放量不回落，腾讯/小米是否跟随。</span></div></div></section><section class=\"module full\"><h3>风险雷达</h3><div class=\"risk-list\"><div class=\"risk-item\"><i class=\"risk-dot high\"></i><span>MU 利好被提前计价，半导体冲高兑现。</span></div><div class=\"risk-item\"><i class=\"risk-dot high\"></i><span>中东消息推升油价，压制风险偏好。</span></div><div class=\"risk-item\"><i class=\"risk-dot\"></i><span>恒指期货偏弱，港股权重若不同步会拖累反弹。</span></div></div></section></div>"
