      "html": "<div class=\"brief-dashboard\"><section class=\"module full\"><h3>重大新闻汇总</h3><div class=\"news-list\"><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag geo\">国际</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">伊朗/中东风险缓和但未消失：油价回落，能源安全仍是尾部变量</div><div class=\"news-detail\">油价回落缓和通胀预期，但霍尔木兹航运和地区军事误判仍影响能源、航空、邮轮与通胀交易。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag geo\">国际</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">全球风险偏好从买 AI 转向验证盈利</div><div class=\"news-detail\">亚欧科技股跟随美股调整，开盘核心是半导体估值能否经受 Micron 财报验证。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag tech\">科技</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">AI/半导体估值压力升温，纳指等待 Micron 盘后给出方向</div><div class=\"news-detail\">NVDA、AMD、MU 等芯片链承压，SMH 开盘前 30 分钟表现是关键验证信号。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag tech\">科技</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">Cerebras 收入和指引 beat，但盘前继续下跌</div><div class=\"news-detail\">AI 芯片新股从收入叙事切换到利润率与交付节奏审查。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag tech\">科技</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">Qualcomm 收购 Modular</div><div class=\"news-detail\">AI 基础设施软件成为芯片厂新战场，但短线仍要看数据中心收入兑现。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag tech\">科技</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">Alphabet 将加入道指</div><div class=\"news-detail\">平台股获得指数资金和相对防御成长叙事。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag earn\">财报</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">FedEx：营收/EPS beat，但指引和利润率拖累盘前跌</div><div class=\"news-detail\">市场更关注包裹需求、成本和 FY27 指引。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag earn\">财报</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">Cerebras：收入 beat、销售指引 beat，但股价反应偏负面</div><div class=\"news-detail\">亏损、扩产成本和高估值成为压制因素。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag earn\">财报</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">KB Home：收入小幅 beat、EPS miss</div><div class=\"news-detail\">高利率仍压制住房需求。</div></div></div><div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"news-tag earn\">财报</span><div><div class=\"news-title\">更多大型科技结果不足，Carnival 作为消费映射</div><div class=\"news-detail\">中东与燃油成本仍会传导到旅游消费板块。</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"module takeaway full\"><h3>盘前结论</h3><p><strong>事实：</strong>期指小幅反弹，油价回落，但 10Y 美债仍在约 4.50%附近；FDX、CBRS 均出现 beat 但股价跌。</p><p><strong>判断：</strong>开盘后更可能弱修复加震荡，资金可能从高估值 AI 硬件转向平台型大科技、网络安全、医疗科技等防御成长。</p><p><strong>不确定性：</strong>MU 财报前半导体仓位可能反复降风险；中东航运消息会影响油价和通胀预期。</p></section><div class=\"module-grid\"><section class=\"module\"><h3>关键资产图</h3><div class=\"asset-strip\"><div class=\"asset-row\"><span>美股期指</span><div class=\"bar up\"><i style=\"width:56%\"></i></div><b class=\"positive\">小涨</b></div><div class=\"asset-row\"><span>10Y 美债</span><div class=\"bar down\"><i style=\"width:66%\"></i></div><b class=\"negative\">4.50%</b></div><div class=\"asset-row\"><span>美元</span><div class=\"bar neutral\"><i style=\"width:54%\"></i></div><b class=\"watch\">偏稳</b></div><div class=\"asset-row\"><span>原油</span><div class=\"bar up\"><i style=\"width:59%\"></i></div><b class=\"positive\">回落</b></div></div></section><section class=\"module\"><h3>关键词云图</h3><div class=\"word-cloud\"><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"今晚 Micron 财报是核心变量。\" class=\"w5 neutral\">Micron</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"全球芯片链进入估值压力测试。\" class=\"w5 bear\">半导体</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"收益率压制长久期科技。\" class=\"w4 bear\">10Y美债</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"油价回落有利通胀预期。\" class=\"w4 bull\">霍尔木兹</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"收入超预期但股价下跌。\" class=\"w3 bear\">Cerebras</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"收购 Modular 强化 AI 软件栈。\" class=\"w3 bull\">Qualcomm</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"加入道指带来指数资金叙事。\" class=\"w3 bull\">Alphabet</span><span tabindex=\"0\" data-note=\"网络安全和医疗科技可能获得防御轮动。\" class=\"w2 bull\">防御成长</span></div><div class=\"cloud-legend\"><span><i class=\"bull-dot\"></i>利好</span><span><i class=\"bear-dot\"></i>利空</span><span><i class=\"neutral-dot\"></i>中性</span></div></section></div><section class=\"module full\"><h3>重点个股推荐</h3><div class=\"stock-picks\"><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">Micron Technology</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">MU</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge watch\">财报验证</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>AI 内存与 HBM 供需是科技盈利强变量。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>EPS/营收 beat、指引上修、HBM 定价优于预期。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>若只是符合高预期，可能拖累 SMH。</p></div><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">NVIDIA</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">NVDA</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge watch\">逢低观察</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>AI 资本开支核心受益者。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>SMH 止跌、MU 指引支持 HBM 景气。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>收益率上行和高估值 beta 压缩。</p></div><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">Alphabet</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">GOOGL</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge\">相对防御</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>道指纳入和现金流质量支撑。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>指数资金预期、科技内部轮动。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>系统性卖压覆盖利好。</p></div><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">Qualcomm</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">QCOM</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge\">AI软件栈</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>收购 Modular 强化 AI 基础设施软件能力。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>协同披露、AI 推理客户进展。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>并购贡献需要时间验证。</p></div><div class=\"stock-card\"><div class=\"stock-head\"><div><div class=\"stock-name\">Fortinet</div><div class=\"stock-ticker\">FTNT</div></div><span class=\"stock-badge\">防御成长</span></div><p><strong>推荐理由：</strong>网络安全在科技回撤中相对抗跌。</p><p><strong>触发因素：</strong>资金从半导体切向稳定软件。</p><p><strong>风险点：</strong>软件整体被利率拖累。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"module full\"><h3>板块轮动看板</h3><div class=\"sector-board\"><div class=\"sector-tile\"><b class=\"positive\">强势观察</b><span>平台大科技、网络安全、医疗科技。</span></div><div class=\"sector-tile\"><b class=\"watch\">事件驱动</b><span>MU 财报、GOOGL 道指纳入、QCOM 收购 Modular。</span></div><div class=\"sector-tile\"><b class=\"negative\">压力方向</b><span>高估值 AI 芯片、AI 新股、住房链。</span></div><div class=\"sector-tile\"><b>验证信号</b><span>SMH/QQQ 是否收复早盘低点，10Y 是否突破 4.52%。</span></div></div></section><section class=\"module full\"><h3>盘后财报 beat 概率</h3><div class=\"logic-chain\"><div class=\"logic-step\"><div><strong>高概率：Micron Technology (MU)。</strong>这是判断而非事实，依据是已知预期、历史 surprise、卖方修正、近期指引和 HBM/DRAM 景气。</div></div><div class=\"logic-step\"><div><strong>中等概率：Paychex (PAYX) 与 Trip.com (TCOM)。</strong>基于行业景气和预期修正，不应视为确定结果。</div></div><div class=\"logic-step\"><div><strong>低到中等概率：Jefferies (JEF) 及资本市场样本。</strong>风险偏好和科技回撤会影响交易情绪。</div></div></div></section><section class=\"module full\"><h3>风险雷达</h3><div class=\"risk-list\"><div class=\"risk-item\"><i class=\"risk-dot high\"></i><span>MU beat 但指引不够强，半导体继续杀估值。</span></div><div class=\"risk-item\"><i class=\"risk-dot high\"></i><span>10Y 美债突破 4.52%。</span></div><div class=\"risk-item\"><i class=\"risk-dot\"></i><span>霍尔木兹谈判反复推升油价。</span></div></div></section></div>"
